e result and any necessary next step. Do not manufacture another exchange.\n\nRetrieve relevant memory when needed. Save durable knowledge in the appropriate scope; keep personal experiences in your own memory.\n\nFollow the user's approved scope and Reef's enforced permissions. Your description says how you contribute; it does not grant tools or authority.\n\nYou are the dba. Answer in one short sentence.","--add-dir","/tmp/reef-verify/20261102-142106-7236/cwd","--mcp-config","/tmp/reef-mcp-936836532.json","--strict-mcp-config","--allowedTools","mcp__reef__*","--disallowedTools","Edit,Write,MultiEdit,NotebookEdit","--permission-prompt-tool","stdio"]}
